# ESG Compliance Agent Rules

- Read AGENTS.md before loading skills
- Use lifecycle commands: /spec, /plan, /build, /validate, /review, /backfill, /ship
- Run full E2E: `make e2e` or `python scripts/e2e_pipeline.py`
- Orchestration tiers: deterministic router (default), LLM planner (`ESG_ORCHESTRATION_MODE=planner`), full agent (`agent.py`)
- All filing-bound artifacts: `assurance_status: pending_sustainability_assurance_sign_off` until sustainability assuror sign-off
- Never submit filings without human approval token
- Never guess emission factors or legal conclusions
- Route cross-border data through cross-border-data-transfer skill
